# Normally nothing to configure: the Go server serves the built site, so API
# calls are same-origin, and in development the Vite proxy forwards /api and
# /uploads to http://localhost:8080.
#
# Only if you host the site somewhere else, copy this to .env.production and
# set the backend origin (and list the site's origin in the backend's CORS_ORIGINS):
# VITE_API_BASE=https://api.your-portfolio.example
